      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219456/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in 1/2 of the Cheddar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yKtJr8EEb3hbw0k2UBKHpFytfCk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-219456-healthier-buffalo-chicken-dip-VAT-step-03-2cheesestirredin-29697e49ad834c3b9f75e809bb7a759b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219456/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer mixture to a slow cooker. Sprinkle remaining Cheddar over top. Cover and cook on Low until hot and bubbly, about 30 minutes.",
